       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           I D E N T I F I C A T I O N   D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM NAME
      ******************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. SWM4809BM.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                      - MENSAGENS SWIFT -                       *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * RECONCILIAÇÃO AUTOMÁTICA DE OPERAÇÕES  (Nivel 9)               *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      *           L O G     D E     A L T E R A C O E S                *
      ******************************************************************
      *  INICIO  * AUTOR  * FIM  S *  C O M E N T A R I O S            *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           E N V I R O N M E N T         D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                      INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                   D A T A   D I V I S I O N                    *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                          FILE SECTION                          *
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                     *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE'.
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWM4809BM'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * TABELAS
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD9701 END-EXEC.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY SXCL0002.
           COPY SXCL0445.
           COPY ETCL1000.
           COPY ETCK0002.
      ******************************************************************
      * CONSTANTES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT9701             PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT9701'.
           05 CON-SWPARAM              PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWPARAM'.
           05 CON-PEND                 PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-RECONC               PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
           05 CON-RECONC-PROP          PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RP'.
           05 CON-AUTOMATICA           PIC  X(01) VALUE 'A'.
           05 CON-MANUAL               PIC  X(01) VALUE 'M'.
           05 CON-MT940                PIC  X(05) VALUE 'MT940'.
           05 CON-MT950                PIC  X(05) VALUE 'MT950'.
           05 CON-O00                  PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.
           05 CON-SPACES               PIC  X(01) VALUE ' '.
           05 CON-NAO                  PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           05 CON-CREDITO              PIC  X(01) VALUE 'C'.
           05 CON-IRECONC-SIM          PIC  X(01) VALUE 'S'.
           05 CON-IRECONC-NAO          PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           05 CON-CEDEBE               PIC  X(07) VALUE '/CEDEBE'.
           05 CON-CEDEBE2              PIC  X(07) VALUE 'CEDEBE/'.
           05 CON-ABSA                 PIC  X(04) VALUE 'ABSA'.
           05 CON-CGDIMA               PIC  X(06) VALUE 'CGDIMA'.
           05 CON-SPOT                 PIC  X(04) VALUE 'SPOT'.
           05 CON-PGT                  PIC  X(03) VALUE 'PGT'.
           05 CON-CEDENCIA             PIC  X(04) VALUE 'FAS-'.
           05 CON-CEDENCIA1            PIC  X(02) VALUE '-1'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * VARIAVEIS
      ******************************************************************
       01 WS-VARIAVEIS.
      *
          05 WS-MRVLR                     PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                           VALUE ZEROS.
      *
          05 WS-COUNT                 PIC S9(10) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
          05 WS-MRDMOV-1              PIC X(40).
          05 WS-MRDMOV-2              PIC X(40).
          05 WS-CCODEST               PIC X(02).
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * SWITCHES
      ******************************************************************
       01  SW-SWITCHES.
           05 SW-CURSOR-STATE              PIC S9(03) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-OK                         VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-END                        VALUE -1.
           05 SW-RECONC-STATE              PIC S9(03) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO                  VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-RECONC-OPER                      VALUE -1.
      *
           05 SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS           PIC  X(01)      VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-OK                            VALUE 'S'.
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK                         VALUE 'N'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * COPYS
      ******************************************************************
      *
           COPY VIAK0001.
           COPY VIAL0015.
           COPY SWCK0001.
           COPY SWCK0002.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * DB2
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE'.
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                        LINKAGE SECTION                         *
      ******************************************************************
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY SWCL4809.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ETCL0002-COMMAREA
                                SWCL4809-COMMAREA.

      ******************************************************************
      *              P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N               *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           MOVE '0000-MAINLINE    '        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.

           MOVE SPACES                     TO ETCL0002-DEBUG.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
                 THRU 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0000-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           GOBACK.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE SW-SWITCHES.
      *
           SET ETCL0002-RCODE-OK       TO TRUE.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO WS-CCODEST
                                          WS-MRDMOV-1
                                          WS-MRDMOV-2.
           MOVE ZEROES                 TO SW-RECONC-STATE.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE
                 THRU 1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO          TO TRUE.

           PERFORM 2100-RECONCILIACAO-FASE-1
              THRU 2100-RECONCILIACAO-FASE-1-EXIT.
      *
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * 2100-RECONCILIACAO-FASE-1                                     **
      ******************************************************************
       2100-RECONCILIACAO-FASE-1.
      *
           MOVE '2100-RECONCILIACAO-FASE-1' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCL4809-IN-CBAN           TO SWCD9701-NCCCCBAN.
           MOVE SWCL4809-IN-CSPAI          TO SWCD9701-NCCCCSPAI.
           MOVE SWCL4809-IN-CMOED          TO SWCD9701-MRMOED
           MOVE SWCL4809-IN-MVALOR         TO SWCD9701-MRVLR

           STRING FUNCTION TRIM(SWCL4809-IN-CREF) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  ' //' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  FUNCTION TRIM(SWCL4809-IN-CREFOPR) DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO WS-MRDMOV-1

           STRING FUNCTION TRIM(SWCL4809-IN-CREF) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  '//' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  FUNCTION TRIM(SWCL4809-IN-CREFOPR) DELIMITED BY SIZE
             INTO WS-MRDMOV-2
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT MRNOPR
                INTO :SWCD9701-MRNOPR
                FROM SWVT9701
               WHERE MRDMOV   IN (:WS-MRDMOV-1,
                                  :WS-MRDMOV-2)
                 AND NCCCCBAN  = :SWCD9701-NCCCCBAN
                 AND NCCCCSPAI = :SWCD9701-NCCCCSPAI
                 AND MRVLR     = :SWCD9701-MRVLR
                 AND MRMOED    = :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                 AND IDRECONC   = 0
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9020-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-OK
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER      TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 2900-UPD-MOVIM
                      THRU 2900-UPD-MOVIM-EXIT
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-NOTFND
                   MOVE ZEROES             TO SWCD9701-MRNOPR
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO  TO TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-MULTROW
                 MOVE '*** MULTROW ***'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
                 IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
                   PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                      THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
                 END-IF
      *
                 SET ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS    TO TRUE
                 SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO    TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO  TO TRUE
                   SET ETCL0002-RCODE-APL  TO TRUE
                   MOVE '2100-RECONCILIACAO-FASE-1'
                     TO ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2100-RECONCILIACAO-FASE-1-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * 2900-UPD-MOVIM                                                 *
      ******************************************************************
       2900-UPD-MOVIM.
      *
           MOVE '2900-UPD-MOVIM'            TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD9701-CUSERID.
      *
           MOVE SWCL4809-IN-IDRECONC       TO SWCD9701-IDRECONC

           MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-1-PARA-1   TO SWCD9701-CNATREC
           MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-AUTOMATICA TO SWCD9701-CTIPREC.
           MOVE SWCK0002-SIM               TO SWCD9701-IRECONC
           MOVE SWCK0002-RECONCILIADO      TO SWCD9701-CCODEST
                                              WS-CCODEST
      *
           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT9701
                 SET IDRECONC  = :SWCD9701-IDRECONC
                   , CCODEST   = :SWCD9701-CCODEST
                   , CNATREC   = :SWCD9701-CNATREC
                   , IRECONC   = :SWCD9701-IRECONC
                   , CTIPREC   = :SWCD9701-CTIPREC
                   , CUSERID   = :SWCD9701-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST   = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
               WHERE MRDMOV   IN (:WS-MRDMOV-1,
                                  :WS-MRDMOV-2)
                 AND NCCCCBAN  = :SWCD9701-NCCCCBAN
                 AND NCCCCSPAI = :SWCD9701-NCCCCSPAI
                 AND MRVLR     = :SWCD9701-MRVLR
                 AND MRMOED    = :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                 AND IDRECONC   = 0
           END-EXEC
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9020-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-OK
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER       TO TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-NOTFND
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
                   SET ETCL0002-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                   MOVE '2900-UPD-MOVIM '
                     TO ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2900-UPD-MOVIM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '3000-FIM-PROGRAMA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE SW-RECONC-STATE         TO SWCL4809-OUT-RECONC-STATE
              MOVE 1                       TO SWCL4809-OUT-COUNT-MOVIM
              MOVE WS-CCODEST              TO SWCL4809-OUT-CCODEST
           END-IF.
      *
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
           COPY ETCP0010.
           COPY VIAP0015.
